flowchart LR
  Syntax[Typed compound literal AST] --> Plan[Typed initializer actions]
  Syntax --> Owner[Explicit C block scope owner]
  File[File-scope literal] --> Global[One local ELF symbol]
  Global --> Reloc[Nested constant-address relocations]
  Owner --> Begin[Begin object at scope entry]
  Begin --> Evaluate[Evaluate initializer into same object]
  Plan --> Evaluate
  Evaluate --> Use[Addressable typed lvalue]
  Use --> Evaluate
  Use --> End[Scope exit retires object]
  End --> VM[Escaped pointer lifetime rejection]
